WEBVTT

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.670
<i>Muscles are an embodiment of love.</i>

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.940
<i>Muscles are a manifestation of dreams.</i>

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:17.020
<i>Working out daily develops your 
love along with your muscles,</i>

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.700
<i>and fosters your dreams.</i>

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.740
<i>Muscles must be made with love and dreams.</i>

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:28.860
<i>And so, the more swole one becomes, 
the nicer they become...</i>

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:40.650
No!

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.610
She seems to be having a bad dream.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:48.680
Should I wake her?

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:52.350
Urk... the muscles... the muscles!

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:53.390
"Muscles"?

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:55.540
I can't eat any more!

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:57.840
This could be fun.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.720
Let's see where this goes.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:03.790
Oh man, I slept well!
 I feel so much better!

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Did</i> you sleep well?

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.460
Yup!

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.170
It sure didn't seem that way.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.830
Huh? Oh, I did have a dream.

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:11.550
How'd it go?

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:14.560
I got too jacked and couldn't 
hold all the muscle,

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:13.740
Macho!

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:18.010
and then Nono-san started trying 
to feed me a ton of konjac.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.700
Konjac!

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.050
Me?!

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:23.230
What's more, the captain had 
hidden protein bars in it.

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:24.720
Doesn't look very hidden.

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:26.330
Macho!

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:30.350
Then, I got even more jacked and was 
primed to win a bodybuilding competition,

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:31.930
but Jun-chan showed up.

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:32.560
I what?

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:35.530
She won and I finished runner-up.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:37.820
Could you not involve me in your nightmares?

00:01:45.490 --> 00:01:48.250
Think you can send the 
Anti-Monkey Rock this time?

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:54.790
I don't know if I've gotten strong enough
in the past month and a half,

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.650
but all I'm thinking about is  
climbing with everything I've got.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:21.660
<b><i>Iwakakeru!</i></b>

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:34.980
<b><i>Wall 4            Powerhouse Climbers</i></b>

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:32.440
Juzo-san, thank you for coaching us again.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:33.760
Thank you!

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:34.980
Pleasure's all mine.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:36.900
Master...

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.680
Let's put down the mats, then.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:38.680
Hello, Kiku-chan.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:39.230
Good idea.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:39.860
How've you been?

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:39.860
Got it.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:41.720
G-Good.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:42.610
Master,

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.470
did you think about what I said last time?

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:51.460
Climb rocks and become
 a true free climber with me.

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:56.160
Sorry I couldn't answer you that day.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.340
But I will today.

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:00.890
Wait for me atop the Anti-Monkey Rock.

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:03.220
Okay. Good luck, Master.

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.420
Thanks. I'll do my best.

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:09.050
She has a fine aura about her.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:10.560
She does.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:17.900
Go, Konomin!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:19.440
Good luck, Konomi-san!

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:35.960
<i>Time for the first crux.</i>

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:38.460
<i>Sloper to crimp.</i>

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:42.110
<i>First, swing my right leg 
and secure my footing.</i>

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:44.590
<i>Slowly raise my body...</i>

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:49.290
<i>Grab the smooth sloper hold, 
shift my body right...</i>

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.120
<i>and pull myself up again.</i>

00:04:56.610 --> 00:04:58.120
Nailed the first crux!

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.610
She's looking good.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.730
But here comes the second crux.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:14.290
<i>She needs to grab the upper part of 
this crack to stabilize herself.</i>

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:18.890
<i>I'm still scared.</i>

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.670
<i>My hands are shaking again.</i>

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.300
<i>But...</i>

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:31.060
<i>I trained so hard with the team</i>

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.680
<i>so I could reach out in this moment!</i>

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:39.360
She's got it!

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.520
No, not yet!

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:43.320
She's still on the lower part of that 
crack. She needs to go one higher.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:46.980
<i>Almost there... Just a little higher.</i>

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:48.200
It hurts!

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:57.180
It's okay. I believe.

00:05:57.180 --> 00:06:00.580
I believe in my mind, my body,

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.490
<i>in my right hand!</i>

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:07.340
Sh...

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:08.920
She secured herself.

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:10.750
Good job, Konomi!

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.850
Take a deep breath and go left to... the...

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.100
<i>That felt so good!</i>

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:20.810
Is she smiling?

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.980
Looks like she's learned 
how to deal with the fear.

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:26.490
Captain?

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.490
Juzo-san's right.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:34.000
It's easy to dismiss fear as a bad thing, 
but it's a crucial warning sign.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:39.620
Climbers who don't feel fear tend to use 
sloppy moves and mess up needlessly.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:43.630
Recklessness isn't a true 
sign of a strong mind.

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:49.880
What is, however, is being fully aware 
of the risks and still having fun,

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.500
which takes real mental toughness.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:09.560
She did it!

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.280
Hell yeah!

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:14.160
Konomi-kun will make a fine climber.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:26.900
So pretty.

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:31.440
It's not even that high up, so why...?

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:33.300
The Anti-Monkey Rock

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.680
is said to be the gateway to hard bouldering.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:38.930
You did it, Master.

00:07:40.530 --> 00:07:42.900
I get why you're so hooked 
on rock climbing now.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:46.390
This view made it really obvious.

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:47.770
Really?

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:49.050
You'll join me, then...

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:50.330
Sorry, Kiku-chan.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:54.570
I can't accept your offer.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.810
I have a dream of my own,

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:59.330
to be the best in Japan.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:04.330
I couldn't have taken in this view if the 
Hanamiya team hadn't helped me practice.

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.340
But you know what, Kiku-chan?

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:10.840
I value our friendship and don't 
want us to drift apart over this.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.840
So, please come watch

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:17.220
the Kanto Bouldering Championship next week.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:22.400
You showed me how fun rock climbing can be.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:26.780
I want to do the same for you, 
except with sport climbing.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:31.960
Just like rock faces have their appeal, 
competitive climbing has its own...

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:36.160
You don't have to, Master. I'm fine 
just knowing how good rock faces are.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.040
B-But Kiku-chan...

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.320
I'm good, really.

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:40.400
Uh, but...

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.360
I'm good.

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:45.770
B-But... But... But...

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:51.180
A student has to come cheer 
for their master, no?!

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:54.090
...no...no...

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.050
You called?

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:58.050
Yeah, I'm your venerable master, you hear?!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:01.560
It is natural that you should 
come cheer me on, you hear?!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:04.810
Such is the nature of a master-student 
relationship, my dear!

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.810
You'll show up, you hear?!

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.860
Master, you're talking weird.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.440
Super weird.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.570
Wh-What's that supposed to mean?

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.620
Got it, Master.

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:22.670
I'll cheer you on at the 
venue as your student.

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.350
I don't think I'll be very loud, but I'll try.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:29.260
Also, I can't say if I'll develop 
an interest in competitive climbing.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.590
It's okay! That's perfectly fine by me!

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:36.990
Man, Konomin, you gave me goosebumps.

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:38.880
Thank you.

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:41.120
Well, slow and steady and all that.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:44.980
Hello? Weren't you the one 
fist pumping like crazy?

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.800
I-I would never!

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.430
You totally were!

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:49.500
Really?

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:50.920
Again, I wasn't.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:53.320
<i>Adding an outdoor rock face to the practice 
schedule paid off spectacularly.</i>

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:52.460
She went all like, "boom!"

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:54.300
Nobody asked for a demonstration!

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:57.030
<i>Yeah, now we can compete.</i>

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.530
Huh? No practice today?

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.530
But the competition's soon, isn't it?

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.880
Instead, we're all going on a little outing.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.770
Another outdoor rock face?

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:12.110
Wrong, Konomin!

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:15.130
Our goal today isn't to grind levels!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.800
<i>Yes

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.840
<i>Equip now?</i>

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:19.150
We're upgrading our gear before 
the boss battle, so to speak!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:23.560
Where are we gonna go for weapons?!

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.310
Here?

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:27.450
This is Rockaround Rock.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:30.840
One of the biggest climbing gyms in Japan,
and a climbing goods store.

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:33.190
Hollo!

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:37.190
Welcome, ladies.

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:39.570
Here I am, Asu-neesan.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.080
Huh? They're sisters?

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.280
I don't think so.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.160
Want a feel? It's been a while.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:46.790
Nah, I'm good.

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.440
"A feel"?

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.760
Yeah... I got felt up a lot.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:55.300
How about you, Yotsuba-chan? Let me 
see if your measurements have changed.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.900
Maybe some other day.

00:10:57.900 --> 00:11:01.160
Konomi-san will be getting naked today.

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:02.310
N-Na...

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.100
Oh, a new member?

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:06.430
N-Nice to meet you! I'm Kasahara Konomi!

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:08.570
The name's Fujimura Asuka.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:11.440
I'm a competitive climber 
and I work the shop here.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:12.980
R-Right...

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.760
Shall we get right to it, then?

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:15.690
U-Uh...

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.990
It's just to check your shoe size.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.450
A-Ah.

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:25.700
<b>Away</b>

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:25.700
<b>Currently helping a customer</b>

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:23.610
You want me to take off my socks, too?

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.700
Of course. It's gotta be your naked feet.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.840
Why "naked" and not "bare"?

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:29.660
Huh?

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.580
Oh, nothing.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:33.830
Soles play a crucial role in bouldering,

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.100
so you feel them directly to check.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:41.840
These feet are lovely. Not arched 
too high and not too wide.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:48.990
Wait, what?!

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:52.330
D-Don't put my feet on your face!

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:55.610
Relax. This helps identify 
the contour of your sole.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:59.230
It's the most accurate method. 
Of course, it takes lots of experience.

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:02.730
You should be okay with a tight fit.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.730
Downturned should be good.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.490
D-Down... what?

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:12.540
<b>Flat</b>

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:12.620
<b>Downturned</b>

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:12.520
Climbing shoes have two kinds 
of soles: flat and downturned.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:18.250
<b>Flat</b>

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:14.830
Flat soles are comfortable

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:18.210
and don't strain your feet much, 
so they're recommended to beginners.

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:24.720
<b>Downturned</b>

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:22.750
Downturned soles give 
you more grip around your toes,

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.720
so they're good for sharp inclines.

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:29.220
After feeling you up, I think this 
would be the best fit for you.

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.730
It's gotta be this one!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.250
Go ahead and try them on.

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:35.600
Okay!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.610
Wow, these are <i>tight</i>.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.700
Will they really work?

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.620
What the heck?

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.340
I feel so light.

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:55.620
<i>They latch on tight to every hold, 
be it with the toes or the heel!</i>

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.700
How do you like 'em?

00:12:56.700 --> 00:13:00.270
Downturned shoes let you "grab" 
holds instead of stepping on them.

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:01.960
They should be perfect for you.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.310
<i>Amazing.</i>

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:05.440
You can make the best 
choice with just a feel.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:07.840
They don't call you the Shoemeister 
Fujimura Asuka for nothing.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:09.530
This is my bread and butter.

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:12.170
I've felt up way more naked 
feet than you can imagine.

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:18.020
<i>With these shoes, I can get 
to holds I couldn't before.</i>

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:21.270
<i>I can take routes I could see but not climb!</i>

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:22.700
<i>With these,</i>

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:34.120
<i>I can keep climbing forever!</i>

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.840
Whaddaya say, Konomi-chan?

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:40.640
Want to try some other pairs?

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:43.050
I can grab that one hold with these.

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:46.550
Wow, it'd be so easy to do a heel hook.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:49.660
Even tough climbs seem so easy now.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:50.360
Oh? I see now.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:52.220
No wonder she's such a quick learner.

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:55.220
By the way, Yotsuba-chan...

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.930
There's a new model out for the thing now.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:58.910
Want to try it?

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:00.060
A new model?

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.700
The shoes elite climbers all swear by.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:07.880
Almost there.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:18.710
So, what do you think our 
chances are, Masumin?

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:24.710
Hard to say. We're up 
against formidable foes,

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:29.060
but that's exactly what 
makes this so worthwhile.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:32.600
We are the St. Caterno Girls' Climbing Team.

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:36.860
We overwhelm the formidable 
with every fiber of our being!

00:14:36.860 --> 00:14:38.230
Yeah!

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:56.840
Dad, I'm ready.

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:57.940
Is that so?

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.790
Shall we go, then?

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.280
Yeah, you're pretty nervous.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:20.440
O-Of course I am!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.030
Unlike last time, I've actually 
practiced a lot for this!

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:26.380
My heart's about to explode!

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:28.530
You're nervous, Master?

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.220
Kiku-chan!

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:31.560
Hello, Master.

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:33.240
You came!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:34.260
Yeah.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:35.720
And Juzo-san?

00:15:35.720 --> 00:15:36.680
There.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.680
Hello, girls.

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.970
Whomst?!

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:43.290
Hello, Juzo-san.

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:46.400
All the best. I'll be rooting for you.

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:48.920
Thank you, Juzo-san!

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:53.470
Well, Master? Dad's a hunk 
clean-shaven, too, isn't he?

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.200
Y-Yeah...

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.220
Wanna marry him?

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:57.390
I don't!

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:04.080
Juzo-san looked nothing like 
he does when he's climbing.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:06.000
He's a different person clean-shaven.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:08.810
He's so handsome. His suit 
looked great on him, too.

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:12.360
Talk about calm and compawsed!

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.880
Checking out men before a tourney?

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:19.050
Hanamiya? More like Hunkamania, amirite?

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:22.340
I admire your ability to always 
be obnoxious, Uchimura.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:26.380
Did you forget how you got 
owned in lead last time?

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:29.480
Wha... What did mew say? 
Don't make it sound like...

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:31.010
Stop, Akane-chan.

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:34.130
You mustn't be so aggressive.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:38.470
I apologize if Akane-chan offended you.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:39.420
Oh, no.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.220
Hey, Niijima-senpai!

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:46.680
We at Matsuhashi High live by the 
motto of, "Climb your dreams"!

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:50.760
We'll soar to our goals fair and square. 
Good luck beating us.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:54.280
"Climb your dreams," my ass.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.160
It's mewningless without winning.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.520
I have to agree there.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:02.650
Right? All that effurrrt 
just to lose would be...

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:07.480
Top of the morning to you, Hanamiya ladies.

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:08.790
And also...

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:12.600
U-chi-mu-ra-san!

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:17.180
Gah! Iwamine Chinari... san!

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.520
Eek!

00:17:19.520 --> 00:17:21.680
Where are you going, Akane-chan?

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:28.410
Hello, Iwamine-san, 
and everyone from Kurikawa High.

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:31.680
How motivated are you to win today, 
as one of the favorites?

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:33.130
Motivated?

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:35.920
Not very. At all.

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:37.200
Oh, but perhaps,

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:40.040
you ladies might be?

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.150
Nah, not really.

00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:42.200
I am, forsooth!

00:17:42.710 --> 00:17:45.740
I am Kurikawa's Satou Maruno.

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:49.330
I have watched all of 
Hanamiya's exploits, I have!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:50.380
However!

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:55.470
Since Kurikawa's taking part, 
your exploits will be patched, I daresay!

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:59.710
Well said! Attagirl, Maruno!

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:02.100
Thank you kindly, Cap'n Iwamine.

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:03.560
Mother and daughter?

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.100
Yeah, right.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.290
As Maruno says,

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:12.110
since Kurikawa's participating, we'll be 
taking all the top spots in the prelims.

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:17.760
I may even get to see your adorable faces

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:20.950
twisted in agony by the end of today.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.530
I don't know about that.

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:24.390
My.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.260
Hello there, Fujita Masumi-san.

00:18:28.260 --> 00:18:30.170
Hello, Iwamine-san.

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:34.570
Have you forgotten about St. Caterno?

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:36.840
Hello, Yotsuba-san.

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:39.090
Hello, Fujita-san.

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:47.470
W-Wow, all of the
 Three Climbing Dames are here!

00:18:47.470 --> 00:18:49.120
C-Climbing Dames?

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:49.730
Yeah.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:54.300
It's a name for three girls from our generation

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.480
who are head and shoulders above the rest.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:00.160
Fujita Masumi, St. Caterno Girls'.

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:03.830
Iwamine Chinari, Kurikawa High.

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:07.620
And our captain, Yotsuba Sayo!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.880
Sure, Kurikawa is a strong team.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:16.130
Your confidence certainly isn't misplaced.

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:17.130
That said,

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:21.020
the walls mercilessly slam down conceit.

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:23.140
That's the kind of sport climbing is.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:24.900
What I'm saying is,

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:28.240
comp... compu...

00:19:28.240 --> 00:19:29.680
Complacency is fatal.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:31.140
Complacency is fatal!

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.560
If you're gonna be that way, 
we'll just do the thing.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.670
Wh-What does that even <i>mean?</i>

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.280
Don't ask me.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:42.780
Captain Masumin, I'm afraid you 
aren't getting through to them.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.910
The opening ceremony will begin soon.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.940
Oh, it's time.

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:51.080
All participants are requested to 
head to their assigned positions.

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:51.080
See you all by the wall!

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:55.210
I suppose I should be heading back, as well.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:56.790
See you, Iwamine-san.

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:59.060
Kurikawa will be the one to win, I daresay!

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.330
What's wrong? Still nervous?

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:05.530
I don't know how to react to all 
these larger-than-life people.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:07.340
Yeah, they're all weirdos.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.260
Konomin, are you gonna be okay?

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:22.520
Ultimately, we'll be facing the wall,
 not them.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.140
We'll be battling ourselves.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:28.960
Just follow your own brand of climbing.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.450
My own brand...

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:34.960
You're a lot more confident 
after all that training, right?

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:38.760
You'll be fine as long 
as you don't forget it.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:42.780
You're right, Jun-chan. 
That takes a load off my mind.

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:43.340
Good.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.440
Shall we get going, then?

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.350
Yeah.

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:49.600
Hanamiya High Climbing Team,

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:51.720
aim for victory.

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:53.830
Let's climb!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.070
U-Um...

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:02.400
You're Kurusu Anne-san, right?

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:02.400
It's Anne! So cute!

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:04.410
Can we get an autograph?

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:06.140
Not now, please.

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:09.910
Sure! I'm always cool, Kurusu!

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:16.460
Long time no see.

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:19.590
I never imagined we would reunite here,

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:21.560
Kasahara Konomi.

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:24.130
You're from St. Caterno...

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:28.120
Well, I don't blame you 
for not recognizing me.

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:32.200
Back then, I was but a little 
girl who wanted to be you.

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:36.190
Or, should I say, a quadrille 
who wanted to be an étoile?

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:37.350
Wait...

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:39.470
Precisely.

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:42.860
I'm Ooba Kurea, and I went to 
the same ballet school as you.

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:48.030
You certainly had a far better 
piqué turn than me.

00:21:48.030 --> 00:21:51.950
But in climbing, <i>I'm</i> better than you!

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.910
On the walls, <i>I'm</i> the star!

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:55.660
Here, all you're good for

00:21:56.390 --> 00:21:59.040
is to be part of the corps de ballet.

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b><i>Iwakakeru!</i></b>

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.060
<b><i>Wall 5: Hard Work and Talent</i></b>
